<<~ ahu #the-refusal >>

! Admission on a Lineage ~ an OUTLINE, and what would refute it

''It sits here so it can be KILLED.'' A finding filed as canon before it is proven becomes the incumbent
lineage that eats the evidence — which is, with an irony the author declines to soften, ''exactly the''
''failure this outline names'' (#the-shadow). Every claim below reads as a ''hypothesis with a named''
''refutation'', and each one names the experiment that would sink it.

''Two of those experiments have now run, and the outline survived them'' (#what-would-prove-it, 2 and 5).
The fold stands built and attacked in `lineage-rank`: the sybil bound HELD, and the distortion measurement
''refuted the outline's own prediction'' — distant kin do not starve with depth, they starve with BRANCHING,
which the author had conflated. The register moves by the promise made here, not around it.

''What still rides uncredited.'' Lemma 3 stands MEASURED but not re-derived under an append-only signed DAG
(1); the dangling-sink policy stays unsettled (3); no counterexample to C4 has been attempted (4); and the
shadow — original antigenic sin — carries ''no instrument at all'' (6), which stays the gravest of the four
because the failure reads invisible from inside and ''every gate we own would glow green through it.''

<<~ confidence Synthesis 11/20 >> The MECHANISM reads measured; the SYNTHESIS around it does not.

<<~/ahu >>

<<~ ahu #tolerance-outranks-this-gate >>

!! The ruling this gate sits under

''A Sybil detector IS a refugee detector — measured.'' Detection accuracy falls to random as modularity rises (r = −0.81 across eight real graphs), and every graph defence reduces to local community detection around a trusted node. So no lineage instrument distinguishes //deferred// reciprocity from //fake//; a stranger who cannot yet reciprocate and a minted face read identically to every measure below.

Which places this whole gate: it ''prices and bounds'', and it MUST NOT adjudicate who is real. The crossing that fails here leaves a party ''at the floor with a degraded cap-stack'' — entry free, reach bounded, caps composing upward as standing accrues — never refused as inauthentic. `anergy-not-ban` states the same law from the other side.

''The stack's brief makes this binding rather than merely prudent'': the recently-arrived case reads as the acceptance test, and a gate that hardens against the unvouched hardens against exactly whom this infrastructure exists for.

